<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>63.0</apiVersion>
    <actionCalls>
        <name>GeneratePdfFile</name>
        <label>Action: Generate PDF File</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>500</locationY>
        <actionName>PdfFileGenerator</actionName>
        <actionType>apex</actionType>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>GetGeneratedFile</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>ShowGenerationError</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>html</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>authorizationHtml</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>title</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>fileTitle</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>recordId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <outputParameters>
            <assignToReference>contentVersionId</assignToReference>
            <name>contentVersionId</name>
        </outputParameters>
    </actionCalls>
    <description>All countries. GQ.AUT.HU037 RN 9 - fully declarative variant: the document layout lives in the authorizationHtml Text Template (admin-editable, no deploy) and the PDF is produced by the in-house generic action PdfFileGenerator (Blob.toPdf, Spring 26). Reads the display stamps kept by Assigned Resource After Handler, so the printed vehicle and advisor are always current. Candidate to REPLACE the Visualforce variant if the Blob.toPdf layout fidelity is approved (side-by-side test); otherwise the VF flow remains the R1 route.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fileTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>'AutorizacionTestDrive_' &amp; {!GetServiceAppointment.AppointmentNumber}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>GenerateTestDriveAuthorizationNativePdf {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Generate Test Drive Authorization Native PDF</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>Flow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetServiceAppointment</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Service Appointment</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>120</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>GetCustomerAccount</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ServiceAppointment</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>AppointmentNumber</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>SchedStartTime</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>SchedEndTime</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Street</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>City</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>AccountId</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>ServiceTerritoryId</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>AdvisorName__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>VehicleDescription__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>DriverLicenseNumber__c</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetCustomerAccount</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Customer Account</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>240</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>GetBranchTerritory</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>GetServiceAppointment.AccountId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Account</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Name</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetBranchTerritory</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Branch Territory</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>360</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>GeneratePdfFile</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>GetServiceAppointment.ServiceTerritoryId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ServiceTerritory</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Name</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetGeneratedFile</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Generated File</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>620</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>ShowGeneratedAuthorization</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>contentVersionId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ContentVersion</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>ContentDocumentId</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <formulas>
        <name>fileUrl</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>'/lightning/r/ContentDocument/' &amp; {!GetGeneratedFile.ContentDocumentId} &amp; '/view'</expression>
    </formulas>
    <screens>
        <name>ShowGeneratedAuthorization</name>
        <label>Screen: Show Generated Authorization</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>740</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>GeneratedText</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Autorizaci&#243;n generada.&lt;/b&gt; El PDF qued&#243; guardado en los archivos de la cita.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;{!fileUrl}&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Abrir la autorizaci&#243;n (PDF) para imprimir&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Sugerencia: en org Spring 26, reemplazar este enlace por el componente est&#225;ndar File Preview apuntando a {!GetGeneratedFile.ContentDocumentId}.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <screens>
        <name>ShowGenerationError</name>
        <label>Screen: Show Generation Error</label>
        <locationX>440</locationX>
        <locationY>620</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>ErrorText</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;No se pudo generar la autorizaci&#243;n.&lt;/b&gt; Detalle para el administrador:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!$Flow.FaultMessage}&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>GetServiceAppointment</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>authorizationHtml</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color:#1a3f6b;&quot;&gt;Autorizacion de Prueba de Manejo - Grupo Q&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cita {!GetServiceAppointment.AppointmentNumber}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;6&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td width=&quot;30%&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cliente&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetCustomerAccount.Name}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Licencia de conducir&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetServiceAppointment.DriverLicenseNumber__c}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vehiculo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetServiceAppointment.VehicleDescription__c}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Asesor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetServiceAppointment.AdvisorName__c}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sucursal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetBranchTerritory.Name}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inicio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetServiceAppointment.SchedStartTime}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetServiceAppointment.SchedEndTime}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Direccion (a domicilio)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{!GetServiceAppointment.Street} {!GetServiceAppointment.City}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:11px; text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;El cliente declara que la informacion consignada es correcta, que posee licencia de conducir vigente y que acepta las condiciones de la prueba de manejo establecidas por Grupo Q. [Texto legal definido por el negocio]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;50%&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;_______________________&lt;br/&gt;Firma del cliente&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;50%&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;_______________________&lt;br/&gt;Firma del asesor / recepcion&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:9px; color:#777;&quot;&gt;Documento generado desde Salesforce (HU-037). Licencia registrada = validada al momento del agendamiento.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <variables>
        <name>contentVersionId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>recordId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
</Flow>
